# Quick Reference for Local Development

## Start Everything (1 command)
bash scripts/dev-up.sh

## Start Manually (3 terminals)
# T1: Database
bash scripts/dev-db-up.sh && bash scripts/dev-db-reset.sh

# T2: Backend
cd backend && npm run start:dev

# T3: Frontend
cd frontend && npm start

## Test Users
Athlete:  athlete@example.com
Coach:    coach@example.com
Owner:    owner@example.com

Note: IDs are UUIDs. Get them from database:
  docker-compose exec postgres psql -U postgres -d crossfit_box_dev \
    -c "SELECT email, id FROM users;"

## Database
Host:     localhost
Port:     5432
Username: postgres
Password: postgres
Database: crossfit_box_dev

## API Base URL
http://localhost:3000

## Database Access
docker-compose exec postgres psql -U postgres -d crossfit_box_dev

## Reset Database
bash scripts/dev-db-reset.sh

## Check Setup
bash scripts/validate-setup.sh

## Documentation
- Quick start:      QUICKSTART.md
- Comprehensive:    docs/LOCAL_DEV.md
- Technical details: SETUP_SUMMARY.md
- Delivery summary: DELIVERY.md

## Stop Everything
Ctrl+C (in dev-up.sh foreground process)
